meta {
  name: 6. Volume units (UCUM canonical = m3)
  seq: 6
}

docs {
  ValueSet/$validate-code with the IG's ValueSet `BeVolumeUnitsVS` sent inline (the server does not have the IG).

  All UCUM units whose canonical unit is m3. A bare annotation has no canonical unit and is outside the value set, but an annotation on a volume unit (`mL{spoon}`) has the same canonical unit as mL and is inside.
}
